areas[11]{zone,why,check}:
  packages/shared/src/,"255+ files auto-generated by openapi-typescript-codegen from the live API's /api-json; any hand edit is lost on the next regeneration","never read or edit it; after changing a server DTO add @ApiProperty/@ApiResponse, start the api on port 34301, run pnpm generate:shared, then pnpm type-check. apps/api itself must NEVER import @boffmedia/shared (it widens tsc rootDir) — it keeps a duplicate roles.constants.ts on purpose"
  apps/api/drizzle/migrations/ (latest 0040_house_accounts.sql),"MySQL DDL is not transactional, so drizzle-kit migrate has half-applied migrations and reported only `undefined` as the error; FK auto-names can overflow MySQL's 64-char identifier cap","read the emitted SQL before running migrate; explicit DEFAULT NULL on nullable timestamps (otherwise they become NOT NULL DEFAULT '0000-00-00'); explicit short foreignKey({name}); one composite primaryKey() per table (a second is silently dropped); a real UNIQUE index for any uniqueness rule; never drizzle-kit push"
  apps/api/src/_db/schema/<Domain>.ts,"schema and live prod columns have drifted before (a varchar(256) live vs varchar(32) in schema); the drizzle CLI reads DATABASE_URL while the app runtime reads DB_HOST/DB_USER, so the two can point at different databases","follow .claude/context/db-naming.md (frozen 2026-07-28); confirm which connection a failing command uses before diagnosing; build queries on schema objects, never a hardcoded table name in a raw sql`` template"
  "apps/api/src/api/auth/jwt-auth.guard.ts + api/_utils/guards/roles.guard.ts","canActivate resolves IS_PUBLIC_KEY by scanning handler then class and taking the first defined value, so a class-level @Public() silently neuters @UseGuards on every route in that controller","never put @Public() on a controller class that contains guarded routes — mark the individual public GETs instead; read jwt-auth.guard.ts and roles.guard.ts together; MinecraftMiddleware (apps/api/src/minecraft.middleware.ts) gates non-GET /smartrotom/* but is a tripwire, never an auth boundary — its server value ships client-side"
  "money/economy: apps/api/src/api/smartrotom/starbank/ + gobierno/hacienda","the web side has TWO parallel data-access styles and money uses the less obvious one: there is no starbankService.ts under services/api/smartrotom/ at all — live money calls go through rotomPOSTOrThrow (apps/web/src/services/http/rotom-client.ts) against route strings inside apps/web/src/app/smartrotom/starbank/_hooks/useStarBank.ts and taxi/_hooks/queries.ts, not through a *Service.ts","never assume a domain has a services/api/smartrotom/<x>Service.ts — check the app's own _hooks/ first, and grep for real callers before trusting any canonical-looking service; money columns must be notNull with a default; transfers must be atomic at the DB level, not only guarded in the service"
  "apps/web/src/services/mcef/mcefApi.ts + mcefHelper.ts","fixed native bridge into the Minecraft client; query names are case-sensitive and a wrong one fails silently (the whole camera surface was dead this way); keybinds can push an event twice","extend mcefApi.ts via mcefQuery<T>() only — never invent a new window.mcefQuery shape; confirm the exact query name against the contract docs (docs/DARCAJA.md, docs/STARBANK.md); guard call sites with isMinecraft() and provide the placeholder fallback; take one keybind event, never both"
  "apps/web/src/i18n/request.ts + i18n/scopes.ts + apps/web/locales/{es,en}/","a namespace missing from request.ts's paths array resolves to nothing with no error; scopes.ts is single-writer so concurrent edits silently blank a route's copy without failing check:i18n; the do-not-translate glossary is not enforced (Trino/Retrino shipped mistranslated)","register every new namespace in request.ts, and in scopes.ts at creation time if route-scoped; run pnpm generate:i18n, pnpm check:i18n, pnpm type-check; check the glossary in .claude/context/i18n.md before translating any coined in-app term"
  "design systems: apps/web/src/components/ui/primitives/ vs components/smartrotom/ui/ vs each SmartRotom app's own","crossing the Boffmedia and SmartRotom systems is explicitly forbidden, and SmartRotom is not one system — individual apps ship their own (12+ namespaces in tailwind.config); v3 is Tailwind-only","never import across systems (scripts/check-v3-conventions.mjs enforces it); count namespaces in tailwind.config rather than trusting any stated number; take the closest sibling app as precedent; never create a .css file — keyframes go in the existing animations.css"
  apps/web/next.config.mjs (typescript.ignoreBuildErrors: true),"next build succeeds with real TypeScript errors, so a green build is not a type-safety signal","always run pnpm type-check separately before calling a web change done"
  "scripts/{check-layering,check-v3-conventions,check-i18n,generate-error-codes}.mjs","all four are chained into pnpm lint and encode rules invisible in the component code; check-layering pins LEGACY_BASELINE=12 and fails both on a new unmarked DRIZZLE injection and on a stale LEGACY_DIRECT_DB marker","run pnpm lint (not bare eslint) before declaring a change complete; when removing a direct-DB service, lower LEGACY_BASELINE in the same change; read the failing script's inline comments for the exact rule"
  .claude/context/,"CLAUDE.md's load-on-demand table lists 9 files but only 3 exist (api-standards.md, db-naming.md, i18n.md) — stack.md, architecture.md, conventions.md, web-network.md, hygiene.md, mcef.md and smartrotom.md are missing, so those load instructions are no-ops","do not assume a context file exists because CLAUDE.md references it; fall back to AGENTS.md and these .sdd/repo/ maps"
